= Hamilton Fish

Hamilton Fish of New York was governor of New York, Senator, and trustee of The Bank for Savings in the City of New-York. Fish aims to restore stability to American foreign policy following the Civil War through careful negotiation, measured diplomacy, and an unwavering commitment to peace. A leading <span style="color: #9D2933;">**Moderate**</span> within the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Republican**</span> Party, Fish believes America's interests are best served through prudence rather than provocation.

- @fish_relations: Strengthen International Relations
- @fish_newyork: Consolidate the New York Organization
- @fish_foreign: Conduct Foreign Policy
